# This directory is bind-mounted into the aa-dedicated container as its VAR
# directory, which is where a dedicated server keeps its runtime state:
# ladderlog.txt, user.cfg, ladder.txt, highscores.txt, bans.txt, big_brother,
# and so on. None of that is input to anything and all of it is rewritten on
# every run, so only autoexec.cfg -- the config the measurement depends on --
# is tracked. A run leaves the rest behind; `git status` should stay quiet.
*
!.gitignore
!autoexec.cfg
